      "writtenOn": "2026-08-20T18:03:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Commit Message Discrepancy \u0026 Transaction Sync:\nThe commit message mentions introducing a separate `mTranslateRegionTransaction`, but the implementation here reuses `mTransaction`.\n\nWhile routing `setTransparentRegionHint` through `applyTransactionOnDraw(mTransaction)` is the right direction for BLAST synchronization (as it merges `mTransaction` into `mPendingTransaction` for atomic submission with the drawing frame buffer), please update the commit message to reflect that `mTransaction` is being reused rather than introducing a new transaction object.\n\n*(Generated by Jetski)*",
